olving provides an utterly immersive detective experience<br></li><li>Stunning and picturesque in-game graphics imbue this pixel game with a dynamic visual style<br></li><li>Well-designed sound effects and BGM selections are the icing on the cake that give players a more terrifying atmosphere. </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/226b4ca559ef9b9f0be38364e66616dd.avif?t=1730368745\" /></div><br><br>Discord\uff1a<br>Twitter: @indienova<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/3df1eff742bec033b4b88262a80bc2d0.poster.avif?t=1730368745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/3df1eff742bec033b4b88262a80bc2d0.webm?t=1730368745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/5618a152229262e715f078acf6cfc62c.poster.avif?t=1730368745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/5618a152229262e715f078acf6cfc62c.webm?t=1730368745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/08fff1e9f4e59873a1076374659bd391.poster.avif?t=1730368745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143050/extras/08fff1e9f4e59873a1076374659bd391.webm?t=1730368745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
